      "writtenOn": "2022-04-25T17:00:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, Chris\u0027 2nd (3rd? 4th?) generation didn\u0027t rely on HW tessellation anymore - it uses simpler API techniques, with some very clever pre-built geometry and vertex shading. (It does require some pre-processing steps to bin/sort the paths, which is work that we hope to move to compute shaders).",
      "parentUuid": "21bb8ba4_2f5864a6",
